Yes. Since your goal is **Data Analyst → Data Science**, and you plan to do **MCA after BCA**, I would structure your learning so that you don't study random technologies one by one.

The important thing is: **Data Science is a sequence.** Finish one foundation before moving to the next.

## 🎯 Your overall path

**BCA → Data Analytics → Job/Internship → MCA + Data Science → Data Scientist**

Since you've already chosen the **Data Analytics + Power BI → internship/job → learn Data Science alongside work → transition** path, I would not recommend jumping directly into advanced Data Science now.

